# Build context is the repository root (see web/Dockerfile), but only two trees
# are required: web/ and the shared i18n dictionary. Whitelist those and drop
# everything else — including .env (secrets), .git, and large local artifacts
# such as node_modules and dist.
#
# Last matching pattern wins, so the explicit exclusions below override the
# `!web/**` whitelist.
*
!web/
!web/**
!shared/
!shared/i18n/
!shared/i18n/**

# Local artifacts inside the whitelisted trees.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
